---
// Two outcomes of one flash-loan shape. Setup transactions stay outside the atomic call.
const zh = !Astro.url.pathname.includes('/en/')
const paths = zh
  ? [
      {
        title: '同一笔交易里还清',
        lead: '借出 1,000。0.500000 的总手续费事先放在接收合约里，那是外部测试资金。',
        steps: ['资金池把 1,000 转给接收合约', '回调里可以用这笔钱', '返回前归还本金加总手续费 1,000.500000', '接收合约从 0.500000 变为 0', '借来的币没有留下']
      },
      {
        title: '手续费没带够就回滚',
        lead: '回调里只有 1,000，还不出 1,000.5。资金和合约状态撤销。gas 与 nonce 不撤销。',
        steps: ['资金池同样先转出 1,000', '归还转账失败', '持久日志为空', '余额、授权和回调计数回到交易前', '发送者 nonce 加 1，gas 为 0.000473806 ETH']
      }
    ]
  : [
      {
        title: 'Repaid inside one transaction',
        lead: 'The loan is 1,000. The 0.500000 total fee was already in the receiver. That fee is outside test money.',
        steps: ['The pool transfers 1,000 to the receiver', 'The callback may use that money', 'Before returning, it repays principal plus the 1,000.500000 total fee', 'The receiver goes from 0.500000 to 0', 'No borrowed balance remains']
      },
      {
        title: 'Too little fee, then rollback',
        lead: 'The callback holds only 1,000 and cannot repay 1,000.5. Asset and contract state revert. Gas and the nonce do not.',
        steps: ['The pool still transfers 1,000 first', 'The repayment transfer fails', 'Persistent logs are empty', 'Balances, approvals and the callback count return', 'The sender nonce increases by 1. Gas is 0.000473806 ETH']
      }
    ]
---
<figure class="scene">
  <div class="scene-set">
    <p class="scene-legend">{zh
      ? '部署合约、从水龙头预存手续费，都是这一笔之前的准备。下面只比较那一笔原子调用。'
      : 'Deploying the contract and prefunding the fee are earlier transactions. The two columns compare only the atomic call.'}</p>
    <div class="scene-grid scene-grid-2">
      {paths.map((path) => (
        <article class="scene-card">
          <h3 class="scene-title">{path.title}</h3>
          <p>{path.lead}</p>
          <ol class="step-list">
            {path.steps.map((step) => <li>{step}</li>)}
          </ol>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>{zh ? '图 18-1｜' : 'Figure 18-1 · '}</strong>
    {zh
      ? '成功时，池子把钱交给接收方，接收方在返回前还上本金和总手续费。失败时，这些资金状态一起撤销，但 gas 和 nonce 留下。两笔都不是 Sepolia 上的新交易。'
      : 'On success, the pool sends funds to the receiver, and the receiver repays principal plus the total fee before the call returns. On failure, those fund changes revert together. Gas and the nonce remain. Neither hash is a new Sepolia transaction.'}
  </figcaption>
</figure>
